#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. モノクマじゃなくて、テレビでも見られたらな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I'd\n"
"much rather be able to watch regular TV...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>妙な威圧感がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't help but feel like it's trying to intimidate\n"
"me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あって当たり前か。
#. 重火器とセットの監視カメラなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean...it's a surveillance camera equipped with\n"
"heavy weaponry.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もはや扉とさえ呼べない鉄の塊だ。
#. どうやったって、開きっこない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You can hardly even call this hunk of metal a door. I\n"
"don't see any possible way to get it open...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>レターケースだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the mailbox from before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中には…
#. 死んだみんなの電子生徒手帳が置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The handbooks for everyone who's died so far have been\n"
"placed inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>妙な威圧感がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't help but feel like it's trying to intimidate\n"
"me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あって当たり前か。
#. 重火器とセットの監視カメラなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean...it's a surveillance camera equipped with\n"
"heavy weaponry.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

